{"unit_id":"Exception-H__dsh-gpt56-ptc#card-zh","repo":"Exception-H/dsh-gpt56-ptc","commit":"0c81ee65eb3576f8420c87c2bae01daefefc5242","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"GPT-5.6 PTC 是面向 DSH Web Profile 的自定义预设。Profile Bundle 启动时运行安装器，将官方 Code preset 复制为用户预设并校验挂载。它提供固定的 PTC / Code Mode 会话，以及范围控制、停止条件和通俗表达约定。适合想为 GPT-5.6 Sol、Terra 或 Luna 使用固定编码助手行为的开发者。需要 DSH rc.8、Node.js 20+、pnpm 和已配置的目标模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8-15","presets/gpt56-ptc/agent.cordis.yml:31-45","cordis.patch.yml:4-9"]}
